The original MIT license is preserved in LICENSE. BarTuck retains the
low-level menu-bar discovery, capture, activation, restoration, and panel
positioning foundations while adding a separate application identity,
Apple-Silicon-only builds, automatic notch policy, display status, and a new
interface.

